{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homage to the 90\u2019s horror B movies, REWIND and RECLAIM is a bloodcurling turn based adventure in which your creativity can influence the fate of horror movie heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment different outcomes through VHS tapes, outsmart terrible foes, and find lost footages linked to a mysterious curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/1e431eafbd2579c9c4d9749af5a41e42.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.poster.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.webm?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/bb42dc0d9fa2300c179d22e0ca176c91.mp4?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Alter the scenes of 90's B movies in favor of the last protagonist. Use your ingenuity and your combativeness to defy the odds and make them survive fearsome encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/d16b4a2a75dd63259570932a0586e386.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.poster.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.webm?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/0924470dca9d860ba2c8012ab8a71297.mp4?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experiment with the environment, from a crowbar to a gas can, and help victims confront creatures much stronger than they are in turn-based fights. Explore small scaled but fully-packed maps full of combinaisons that\u2019ll get your brain racking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/fb1c3845043de449f90e40a7c7eb5ab8.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.poster.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.webm?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/2c3ad4bce5cf272a52dbd0d186e9852c.mp4?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every  new run, the layout of the environment, interactable elements and objectives are randomized, keeping the strategy (and the spook!) fresh. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/c3115db2b219ca376f569274cfcee332.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=66 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.poster.avif?t=1761523057\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.webm?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/extras/a8cc26eeb251a4b493082e3e7153f6aa.mp4?t=1761523057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover classical horror settings haunted by a supernatural slasher, an evil puppet, a fleshy atrocity and a monstruous entity. The clich\u00e9 horror villains are out for blood, and they\u2019ll stop at nothing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669250?t=1761523057","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761523057","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/4d512ba2866dd6dbe2324aa6a0fd46715e50f9bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761523057","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669250/4d512ba2866dd6dbe2324aa6a0fd46715e50f9bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761523057","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes characters from horror movies inflicting wounds and murdering teenagers. And vice versa."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A homage to the 90\u2019s horror B movies, REWIND and RECLAIM is a bloodcurling turn based adventure in which your creativity can influence the fate of horror movie heroines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment different outcomes through VH